      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Industrial Relations (Amendment) Bill 2007"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 10 the following section: \"No other claims after trade union has made a claim 10A. Where a claim for recognition by a trade union in respect of workmen or a class of workmen has been made under section 9, no other trade union of workmen shall make a claim for recognition under that section or be accorded recognition in respect of the same workmen or class of workmen until the claim is resolved under paragraph 9{3)(a) or deemed to have been withdrawn under subsection 9(4), or decided by the Minister under subsection 9(5).\". Amendment of section 12"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 12 the following section: \"12. Where a claim for recognition — (a) has been withdrawn by the trade union of workmen concerned after a report has been made by the trade union of workmen to the Director General under subsection 9(4); or (b) has been decided by the Minister under subsection 9(5), resulting in the trade union of workmen concerned not being accorded recognition, such trade union shall not make any further claim for recognition in respect of the same workmen or class of workmen until six months have elapsed from the date of such withdrawal or decision.\". Amendment of section 13"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 13 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: \"(2A) A proposal for a collective agreement may provide for one or more of the following: (a) provision for training to enhance skills and knowledge of the workmen; (b) provision for an annual review of the wage system; and (c) provision for a performance-based remuneration system.\". Deletion of section 15"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by deleting section 15. Amendment of section 16"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 16(5) of the principal Act in amended by deleting the words \"(2) or\". Amendment of section 19B"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 19B(1) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for paragraph (a) the following paragraph: \"(a) an employer who is a party to the trade dispute may — (i) represent himself or be represented by his duly authorized employee; (ii) where he is a member of a trade union of employers, be represented by any officer or employee of such trade union of employers; or (iii) notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in any written law relating to the registration of trade unions, be represented by any official of an organization of employers registered in Malaysia (not being a trade union of employers); and\". Amendment of section 20"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_16__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_16__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 20 of the principal Act is amended —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_16__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_16",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (6) the following \"(6) In any proceedings under subsection (2) — (a) an employer may — (i) represent himself or be represented by his duly authorized employee; (ii) where he is a member of a trade union of employers, be represented by any officer or employee of such trade union of employers; or (iii) notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in any written law relating to the registration of trade unions, be represented by any official of an organization of employers registered in Malaysia (not being a trade union of employers); and (b) a workman may — (i) represent himself; (ii) where he is a member of a trade union of workmen, be represented by any officer or employee of such trade union of workmen; or (iii) notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in any written law relating to the registration of trade unions, be represented by any official of an organization of workmen registered in Malaysia (not being a trade union of workmen).\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_16__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_16",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (8) the following \"(9) Where a workman who has made a representation under subsection (1) attends none of the conferences under paragraph (&)(b) without any reasonable excuse, the representation shall be deemed to have been withdrawn.\". Amendment of section 22"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 22(5) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words \"subsection 20(3)\" the words \"or any application for reference to the High Court under subsection 33A(1)\". Amendment of section 23"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 23(4) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words \"subsection 20(3)\" the words \"or any application for reference to the High Court under subsection 33A(1)\". Amendment of section 23A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 23A of the principal Act is amended by deleting subsection (2). Amendment of section 27"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Industrial Relations (Amendment) Act 2007."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette, and the Minister may appoint different dates for the coming into operation of different provisions of this Act. Amendment of long title"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Industrial Relations Act 1967 [Act 177], which is referred to as the \"principal Act\" in this Act, is amended in the long title by inserting after the words \"An Act\" the words \"to promote and maintain industrial harmony and\". Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/eng@/~cl_20",
